# Day 9: Wazuh rules and levels

## What I learned
- A rule creates an alert when a log matches it
- A decoder splits the log into fields (usr, IP, time)
- Levels go from 0 to 15, higher means more serios

## What I did
- Typed a wrong password on my own Wazuh VM
- Found the alert in the dashboard 
- Read rule.id, rule.description and rule.level
